WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.360
Every week, you talk with a lot of people.

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.400
Your team. Your peers. Your manager.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.180
Each conversation leaves something behind.

4
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.140
By the next one, most of it is gone.

5
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.210
Tainure remembers for you.

6
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:19.890
Paste your notes. It keeps what was said, what you owe, and what to raise next.

7
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.820
From one person to the next, you pick up where you left off.

8
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.690
Stuck? Ask. Any AI gives you tips.

9
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.610
Tainure knows what happened, and the coaching that fits.

10
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.160
And months later, your feedback is still part of the conversation.

11
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.610
Not a manager? Tainure works for you too.

12
00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.770
Ready when your manager asks.

13
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.730
Your last review, turned into next steps.

14
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.640
Private to you.

15
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.660
Tainure. Remember every conversation.
